This repository does not contain third-party plugins. The images it builds fetch
Claude Code plugins at build time, each pinned to a commit in plugins.lock, from:

  - obra/superpowers
  - anthropics/claude-plugins-official
  - fibtecltd/claude-workflows        (fork of wshobson/agents)
  - fibtecltd/python-backend-plugins  (fork of ruslan-korneev/python-backend-claude-plugins)
  - fibtecltd/claude-skills           (fork of alirezarezvani/claude-skills)

Each plugin keeps the licence of its own repository. The images also install
Claude Code, Node.js, the AWS CLI and CDK, the Stripe CLI and other tools under
their own licences; none of them is redistributed in this repository.

